  "importedNotes": [
    {
      "text": "These were divine! They turned out exactly as I hoped they would. They seemed just like a macaroon from a bakery. Wonderful texture and just the right amount of sweetness. The ratio of ingredients works perfectly. I prefer larger shreds of coconut, so …"
    },
    {
      "text": "I skipped the step with the food processor."
    },
    {
      "text": "I mixed all of the ingredients (minus the egg whites and extracts) in the mixer on low speed until well combined."
    },
    {
      "text": "After moving that mixture to a large bowl, I beat the eggs whites and then beat in the extracts."
    }
  ],
